# Animated Density Plot
Here is our basic implementation of a raster density plot function with an extra parameter used for animation:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
# Animated Density Plot
Here is our basic implementation of a raster density plot function with an extra parameter used for animation:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
rasterDensityPlotAnim[f_, {xs_, xmin_, xmax_}, {ys_, ymin_, ymax_}, {ts_, tmin_, tmax_}, OptionsPattern[]] := 
 With[{
   time = Unique[], buffer = Unique[], 
   cf = With[{c=ColorData[OptionValue[ColorFunction]]}, (List@@c[#])&], 
   pts = OptionValue[PlotPoints]//N,
   dt = (tmax-tmin)/OptionValue[PlotPoints]//N
  },
  {
   (*BB[*)(* call to resample our function on a grid *)(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNhYGAo5gcSAUX5ZZkpqSn+BSWZ+XnFaYwgCS4g4Zyfm5uaV+KUXxEMUqxsbm6exgSSBPGCSnNSg9mAjOCSosy8dLBYSFFpKpoKkDkeqYkpEFXBILO1sCgJSczMQVYCAOFrJEU="*)(*]BB*)
   raw := Table[
    f /. {xs -> j, ys -> i, ts -> time} // N, {i, ymin, 
     ymax, (ymax - ymin)/(pts - 1)}, {j, xmin, 
     xmax, (xmax - xmin)/(pts - 1)}]
  },
  
  time = tmin;

  (*BB[*)(* rescale to [0,1] and colorize *)(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNhYGAo5gcSAUX5ZZkpqSn+BSWZ+XnFaYwgCS4g4Zyfm5uaV+KUXxEMUqxsbm6exgSSBPGCSnNSg9mAjOCSosy8dLBYSFFpKpoKkDkeqYkpEFXBILO1sCgJSczMQVYCAOFrJEU="*)(*]BB*)
  buffer = Map[cf, raw // Rescale, {2}];
  
  Graphics[{
    Raster[buffer//Offload, {{xmin, xmax}, {ymin, ymax}}],

    (*BB[*)(* animate infinitely *)(*,*)(*"1:eJxTTMoPSmNhYGAo5gcSAUX5ZZkpqSn+BSWZ+XnFaYwgCS4g4Zyfm5uaV+KUXxEMUqxsbm6exgSSBPGCSnNSg9mAjOCSosy8dLBYSFFpKpoKkDkeqYkpEFXBILO1sCgJSczMQVYCAOFrJEU="*)(*]BB*)
    EventHandler[AnimationFrameListener[buffer//Offload], Function[Null,
      buffer = Map[cf, raw // Rescale, {2}];
      time = If[time >= tmax, tmin, time + dt];
    ]]
  }, Frame->True]
]

Options[rasterDensityPlotAnim] = {ColorFunction->"AvocadoColors", PlotPoints->100};

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
Let's try it on this example function:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Let's try it on this example function:

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
rasterDensityPlotAnim[x Sin[y+t], {x, -5, 5}, {y, 0, 10}, {t, 0, 2Pi}, PlotPoints->50]

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Props:
  Hidden: true
Type: Input
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
.md
:::note
The data is not precalculated, but is generated for each individual frame in real-time.
:::

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
:::note
The data is not precalculated, but is generated for each individual frame in real-time.
